On Wed, Jun 24, 2026 at 10:00:06PM +0800, Richard Cheng wrote:
> Add a negative case to the CXL fwctl test that issues a Get Feature
> FWCTL_RPC with out_len == offset(struct fwctl_rpc_cxl_out, payload) and
